From: Loong <galletzeynep481@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] defenvs: nokia_xg-040g-md: make web recovery the automatic path

Three ways in, none of which needs a serial console:

  - holding reset at power-on starts the web server instead of a one-shot
    TFTP fetch;

  - a board that fails to boot from NAND now loops on httpd instead of
    looping on TFTP, so a bricked unit simply serves its own recovery page
    once a cable is plugged in.  With the DHCP server in httpd the user gets
    an address automatically -- nothing to configure, nothing to install;

  - _firstboot checks the button before it touches the flash.  This is what
    lets a first-time migration finish in a single xmodem round: without it
    the RAM-resident U-Boot runs straight into _init_env, fails to create
    the env volumes on a foreign flash layout, falls back to ubi_format and
    resets -- discarding the U-Boot that was just transferred.

Two helper scripts back the httpd upload form:

  - httpd_write_bl2 writes the preloader at offset 0x800, which is where the
    BootROM looks for the FIP.  mtd_write_bl2 expects the caller to have
    prepended 0x800 blank bytes in RAM; httpd flashes the uploaded part
    where it landed, so it asks mtd to do the skipping instead.

  - httpd_format_ubi is ubi_format without the trailing reset, so the same
    session can go on to write the fip and fit volumes it just made room
    for.

TFTP is deliberately kept: bootmenu entries 1 and 3 still use it, which is
what serial users and scripted flows want.  Automatic path is the browser,
manual path stays TFTP.

--- a/defenvs/an7581_nokia_xg-040g-md_env
+++ b/defenvs/an7581_nokia_xg-040g-md_env
@@ -26,28 +26,31 @@
 boot_first=if button reset ; then led $bootled_status on ; run boot_default ; fi ; bootmenu
 boot_default=run bootcmd ; run boot_tftp_forever
 boot_production=led $bootled_status on ; run ubi_read_production && bootm $loadaddr#$bootconf ; led $bootled_status off
-boot_ubi=run boot_production ; run boot_tftp_forever
+boot_ubi=run boot_production ; run boot_httpd_forever
 boot_tftp_forever=led $bootled_status on ; while true ; do run boot_tftp ; sleep 1 ; done
+boot_httpd_forever=while true ; do httpd ; sleep 1 ; done
 boot_tftp_production=tftpboot $loadaddr $bootfile_upg && env exists replacevol && iminfo $loadaddr && run ubi_write_production ; if env exists noboot ; then else bootm $loadaddr#$bootconf ; fi
 boot_tftp_recovery=tftpboot $loadaddr $bootfile && env exists replacevol && iminfo $loadaddr && run ubi_write_recovery ; if env exists noboot ; then else bootm $loadaddr#$bootconf ; fi
 boot_tftp=tftpboot $loadaddr $bootfile && bootm $loadaddr#$bootconf
 boot_tftp_write_bl2=mw.b $loadaddr 0xff 0x800 ; setexpr loadaddr_bl2 $loadaddr + 0x800 ; tftpboot $loadaddr_bl2 $bootfile_bl2 && run mtd_write_bl2
 boot_tftp_write_fip=tftpboot $loadaddr $bootfile_fip && run ubi_write_fip && run reset_factory
 preboot=led $bootled_status on
-check_buttons=if button reset ; then run boot_tftp ; fi
+check_buttons=if button reset ; then httpd ; fi
 ethaddr_factory=ubi read 0x90000000 ri && env readmem -b ethaddr 0x9000003e 0x6 ; setenv ethaddr_factory
 part_default=production
 reset_factory=ubi part ubi ; mw $loadaddr 0x0 0x800 ; ubi write $loadaddr ubootenv 0x800 ; ubi write $loadaddr ubootenv2 0x800
 mtd_write_bl2=mtd erase bl2 && mtd write bl2 $loadaddr
+httpd_write_bl2=mtd erase bl2 && mtd write bl2 $loadaddr 0x800 $filesize
 ubi_create_board_data=ubi check bosa || ubi create bosa 0x40000 || run ubi_format ; ubi check ri || ubi create ri 0x40000 || run ubi_format
 ubi_create_env=ubi check ubootenv || ubi create ubootenv 0x1f000 dynamic || run ubi_format ; ubi check ubootenv2 || ubi create ubootenv2 0x1f000 dynamic || run ubi_format
 ubi_format=ubi detach ; mtd erase ubi && ubi part ubi ; reset
+httpd_format_ubi=ubi detach ; mtd erase ubi && ubi part ubi
 ubi_prepare_rootfs=if ubi check rootfs_data ; then else if env exists rootfs_data_max ; then ubi create rootfs_data $rootfs_data_max dynamic || ubi create rootfs_data - dynamic ; else ubi create rootfs_data - dynamic ; fi ; fi
 ubi_read_production=ubi read $loadaddr fit && iminfo $loadaddr && run ubi_prepare_rootfs
 ubi_remove_rootfs=ubi check rootfs_data && ubi remove rootfs_data
 ubi_write_fip=run ubi_remove_rootfs ; ubi check fip && ubi remove fip ; ubi create fip 0x100000 static && ubi write $loadaddr fip $filesize
 ubi_write_production=ubi check fit && ubi remove fit ; run ubi_remove_rootfs ; ubi create fit $filesize dynamic && ubi write $loadaddr fit $filesize
 _init_env=setenv _init_env ; run ubi_create_env ; saveenv ; saveenv ; run ubi_create_board_data
-_firstboot=setenv _firstboot ; run ethaddr_factory ; run _switch_to_menu ; run _init_env ; run boot_first
+_firstboot=setenv _firstboot ; run check_buttons ; run ethaddr_factory ; run _switch_to_menu ; run _init_env ; run boot_first
 _switch_to_menu=setenv _switch_to_menu ; setenv bootdelay 3 ; setenv bootmenu_delay 3 ; setenv bootmenu_0 $bootmenu_0d ; setenv bootmenu_0d ; run _bootmenu_update_title
 _bootmenu_update_title=setenv _bootmenu_update_title ; setenv bootmenu_title "$bootmenu_title       [33m$ver[0m"
